      <marc:subfield code="t">From the eighteen century to the 1930s: war and depression --</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="t">1945 to 1975: the golden age --</marc:subfield>
      <marc:subfield code="t">The legacy of the 1970s: a crisis of capitalism --</marc:subfield>
